repository-code: "https://github.com/mustafaras/horizon-quantum-gravity-atlas"
url: "https://mustafaras.github.io/horizon-quantum-gravity-atlas/"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, cinematic atlas of modern physics tracing the path from the
  Standard Model to the open frontier of quantum gravity. Eight modules pair
  rigorous explanation with real-time 3D simulation and live formulas, with an
  honest accounting of what is established, what is an effective model, and
  what remains conjecture. Includes a symbol atlas of notation conventions, an
  interactive glossary, verified classic references, and reproducible visual QA.
keywords:
  - quantum-gravity
  - physics-education
  - interactive-visualization
  - general-relativity
  - quantum-field-theory
  - renormalization-group
  - black-holes
  - gravitational-waves
